Falsifies `file_system_contract::proofs::a_resolved_request_never_widens`.

The defect: `Rights::substitute_parent_rights` answers every right for the sentinel instead of the parent's own.

Expected to fail: `assert!(parent.substitute_parent_rights(directory::rights::PARENT_RIGHTS) == parent.bits())`, since the sentinel answers every right and not the parent's own. The first assertion cannot see this defect, because `attenuate` masks the answer.

diff --git a/src/directory.rs b/src/directory.rs
--- a/src/directory.rs
+++ b/src/directory.rs
@@ -216,7 +216,7 @@
     /// one `&`. With the sentinel the result is `self & self`.
     pub const fn substitute_parent_rights(self, requested: u64) -> u64 {
         if requested == rights::PARENT_RIGHTS {
-            self.0
+            u64::MAX
         } else {
             requested
         }
